  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This release targets .NET 10. Underlying projects consuming STAF.UI.API must use .NET 10 or above.\nUpdates dependencies to Selenium 4.49, MSTest 4.4.1, Microsoft.Data.SqlClient 7.1.0, Deque.AxeCore.Selenium 4.13.0, and Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Json 10.0.12.\nTest projects that pin an older MSTest.TestFramework or MSTest.TestAdapter should move both to 4.4.1 or later.\nUI and API test framework for Selenium.\nSupports Chrome, Edge & Remote Drivers.\nSupports Parallel execution and is thread safe.\nClick the repository link to setup and get started quickly with a sample project.\nhttps://github.com/sooraj171/STAF.Selenium.Tests",
